{
  "title": { "zh": "分拣机" },
  "optional": true,
  "tray": "pipeline",
  "after": {
    "zh": "这台分拣机把局部特征汇总成类别判断：卷积可以找不同的笔画，非线性和池化帮助处理位置变化，分类部分根据特征给各类打分。它在这些新零件上也通过了检查，说明它不只适用于训练例子；要了解它在实际使用中是否可靠，还需要更多有代表性的测试。"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "分拣机正式上线：零件的位置、深浅都不一样，有的带噪点。最后几组是「新零件」，不参加训练，只用来检查。"
      },
      "fig": { "test": 0, "caption": { "zh": "第一组：一个 X" } }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "从图片到类别，网络先提取局部特征，再把特征汇总成类别分数。AlexNet 把卷积、激活、池化和分类层组合起来，用大量图片训练；这一关是缩小后的分类例子。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "换一批新零件时，不一定从零开始：可以复用已经训练好的特征提取部分，只训练新的分类头；如果旧特征不够适合，也可以解冻部分层继续训练，这叫微调。这里仍然从当前任务训练。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "可以使用<level-ref to=\"4-18\"></level-ref>解锁的 Softmax 元件，把三类分数变成概率；也可以自己搭出这一步。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关你要做的：输出三个概率，正确那一类大于 0.55，另两类小于 0.45。要想的问题：三类零件靠哪些笔画区分？网络要看出几种笔画？"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "4-21",
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "传送带上的零件有三种：X、O 和 +，位置、深浅都不一样，有的带噪点。输出三个概率，正确那一类要大于 0.55，另两类小于 0.45。列表最后的「新零件」不参加训练，只用来检查。"
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "一个卷积通道只能看出一种笔画，三类至少要几种？每一类的分，可以由每个通道的特征各给一点。搭好后多按几次训练，看两条误差线。"
      },
      "outputs": ["px", "po", "pp"],
      "outputLabels": { "px": { "zh": "是 X" }, "po": { "zh": "是 O" }, "pp": { "zh": "是 +" } },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.45 },
      "trainRate": 80,
      "scene": "sorter",
      "tests": [
        { "label": { "zh": "X 1" }, "part": "X", "ox": 1, "oy": 2, "ink": 0.75, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X 2" }, "part": "X", "ox": 4, "oy": 3, "ink": 0.8, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X 3" }, "part": "X", "ox": 2, "oy": 5, "ink": 0.85, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "X 4" }, "part": "X", "ox": 3, "oy": 1, "ink": 0.9, "seed": 10 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O 1" }, "part": "O", "ox": 2, "oy": 4, "ink": 0.75, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O 2" }, "part": "O", "ox": 5, "oy": 5, "ink": 0.8, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O 3" }, "part": "O", "ox": 3, "oy": 1, "ink": 0.85, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "O 4" }, "part": "O", "ox": 4, "oy": 3, "ink": 0.9, "seed": 11 },
        { "label": { "zh": "+ 1" }, "part": "P", "ox": 3, "oy": 0, "ink": 0.75, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "+ 2" }, "part": "P", "ox": 0, "oy": 1, "ink": 0.8, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "+ 3" }, "part": "P", "ox": 4, "oy": 3, "ink": 0.85, "seed": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "+ 4" }, "part": "P", "ox": 5, "oy": 5, "ink": 0.9, "seed": 12 },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "新零件 X 1" },
          "part": "X",
          "ox": 5,
          "oy": 4,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 0,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "新零件 X 2" },
          "part": "X",
          "ox": 2,
          "oy": 2,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 20,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "新零件 O 1" },
          "part": "O",
          "ox": 0,
          "oy": 5,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 0,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "新零件 O 2" },
          "part": "O",
          "ox": 3,
          "oy": 3,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 21,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "新零件 + 1" },
          "part": "P",
          "ox": 1,
          "oy": 0,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 0,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "新零件 + 2" },
          "part": "P",
          "ox": 4,
          "oy": 4,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 22,
          "train": false
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "另一批 X 1" },
          "part": "X",
          "ox": 3,
          "oy": 4,
          "ink": 0.85,
          "seed": 0,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "另一批 O 2" },
          "part": "O",
          "ox": 4,
          "oy": 2,
          "ink": 0.9,
          "seed": 31,
          "train": false
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "另一批 + 3" },
          "part": "P",
          "ox": 1,
          "oy": 1,
          "ink": 0.8,
          "seed": 0,
          "train": false
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0 = lrnConv[w=[-0.0236, -0.0048, -0.0633, -0.018, -0.0454, -0.003, -0.0706, -0.0325, 0.0007]](in)",
        "c1 = lrnConv[w=[5.1546, -4.7263, -5.2868, -4.453, 1.752, 1.256, -5.5956, 2.773, 1.3697]](in)",
        "r0 = relu(c0)",
        "r1 = relu(c1)",
        "m0 = maxpool(r0)",
        "m1 = maxpool(r1)",
        "g0 = fqMean(m0)",
        "g1 = fqMean(m1)",
        "dx0 = lrnDense[p=[1.0007, -2.7474]](g0)",
        "dx1 = lrnDense[p=[7.9509, -2.7457]](g1)",
        "do0 = lrnDense[p=[-0.9993, 0.292]](g0)",
        "do1 = lrnDense[p=[1.3535, 0.2911]](g1)",
        "dp0 = lrnDense[p=[0.4991, 2.4436]](g0)",
        "dp1 = lrnDense[p=[-8.7984, 2.444]](g1)",
        "sx = arith[op=add](dx0, dx1)",
        "so = arith[op=add](do0, do1)",
        "sp = arith[op=add](dp0, dp1)",
        "prob = softmax(sx, so, sp)",
        "px <- prob.p1",
        "po <- prob.p2",
        "pp <- prob.p3"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "c0 = lrnConv(in)",
        "c1 = lrnConv[w=[0.015, -0.01, 0.02, -0.02, 0.01, 0.005, -0.015, 0.02, -0.005]](in)",
        "r0 = relu(c0)",
        "r1 = relu(c1)",
        "m0 = maxpool(r0)",
        "m1 = maxpool(r1)",
        "g0 = fqMean(m0)",
        "g1 = fqMean(m1)",
        "dx0 = lrnDense(g0)",
        "dx1 = lrnDense(g1)",
        "do0 = lrnDense[p=[-1, 0]](g0)",
        "do1 = lrnDense[p=[-1, 0]](g1)",
        "dp0 = lrnDense[p=[0.5, 0]](g0)",
        "dp1 = lrnDense[p=[0.5, 0]](g1)",
        "sx = arith[op=add](dx0, dx1)",
        "so = arith[op=add](do0, do1)",
        "sp = arith[op=add](dp0, dp1)",
        "prob = softmax(sx, so, sp)",
        "px <- prob.p1",
        "po <- prob.p2",
        "pp <- prob.p3"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
